/apps/2629630/extras/d68d6461845e5cd6a17d27f0f3a80904.mp4?t=1771837734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629630/extras/9fb9e2968bf5bc1b0470cffdf5b0f657.avif?t=1771837734\" width=1560 height=341 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Each of the 4 Factions offers a singleplayer mode with a completely unique gameplay.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironclad - A classical roguelike deckbuilding experience. Your town is under siege from all sides, upgrade your base and army as you fight off waves of enemies - weighing the cost and benefit of each battle closely so as to not run out of resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undead - Start off as a lonely Undead King and raise the Undead to achieve a critical mass that cannot be stopped!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sylvan - Fight a guerrilla war on multiple fronts with your limited army. Stretch your forces as thinly as possibly to protect the sanctity of your forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demon - All the other factions have rallied against you, your defeat is imminent. Call upon your demonic legions one last time to summon the Scorch that will bring an end to all life in this world.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Skimsi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629630/51ca3d0ea3477abb71a8789881856b6335a5b4d1/header.jpg?t=1771837734","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stro